WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:13.459
What it do? Yo boy Doc Sweets is
BACK and today we gettin spicy with Dune by

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.320
Frank Herbert.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.140
Aight lemme ‘splain somethin real quick.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:25.330
Like 20,000 years in da future, humanity
dun spread their sh** to other planets run

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.869
by hood rich crews called ‘houses’ who
all takin’ their orders from the Emperor.

00:00:30.869 --> 00:00:35.430
This whole space-hood run off a
dank herb called Melange, or “spice” on

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:40.220
the streets. See, the only place you can score
spice is up on the planet of Arrakis, where

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:45.909
they aint nothin but a bunch of sandworm-riding
thugz called Fremen. These cats just sittin

00:00:45.909 --> 00:00:50.809
on they asses waiting for a legendary savior
called “Lisan-al-Gaib” who gonna turn

00:00:50.809 --> 00:00:55.180
Arrakis in to a water filled paradise.
Now there also be a click o’ fine

00:00:55.180 --> 00:01:00.839
biddies called Bene Gesserit who strapped
with bangin super powers. Word is they tryin

00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:06.150
to breed the first ever male super-dude called
the Kwisatz Haderach- whose powers gonna be

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.049
the swoelest of the swoel.

00:01:08.049 --> 00:01:12.789
So one day the emperor tell Duke
Leto of House Atreides that he now top dowg

00:01:12.789 --> 00:01:17.520
of spice mining on Arrakis. Right before they
bounce over to the planet, the duke’s Bene-

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:24.460
G Jessica puts their son Paul to an old-school
test. And truth is, Paul got a mind WAY beyond

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.740
yo erryday thug.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:29.909
Things ain’t quite what they were
expectin on Arrakis. Turns out the emperor

00:01:29.909 --> 00:01:34.530
playin dirty and what he really plottin is
to waste all the playas of House Atriedes.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.219
But instead of comin out and sayin it to their
face, the emperor puts his muscle behind the

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:43.120
homies of House Harkonnen, who been beefin
with the Atriedes fo years.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.940
The Harkonnen’s got an ace in the
hole, though- Duke L’s boy Doc Yeuh. Fool’s

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:52.689
actually a snitch who drops the Duke right
in to Baron Harkonnen’s lap. The Duke try

00:01:52.689 --> 00:01:57.700
to take the Baron down with him, but ends
up just icing himself and some other jabronies.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:02.859
Feelin like a real bitch, Yueh helps Paul
and Jessica bust ass outta there where they

00:02:02.859 --> 00:02:05.619
join up with the Fremen on the outside.

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:10.280
Years pass and Paul now known on
the streets as Paul Maud’Dib. Since Paul

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:15.959
been chewin dat spice all day erry day, his
powers been gettin TURNT UP. Along with Paul’s

00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:20.549
boss fighting skills and clutch leadership,
the Fremen start thinkin he the legendary

00:02:20.549 --> 00:02:26.310
prophet. So M-Deezy rallies up his Fremen
posse to stomp dem Harkonnen scrubs!

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:31.150
But before they roll out, Paul
decide he gonna step up his game. So he takes

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:36.680
a long pull from the water of life. When he
wakes up from a nasty-ass drank nap, his powers

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:42.870
so damn ballin that he can see past, present,
and future like it ain’t no thang. Using

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:47.790
dat sight he find out the emperor dun assembled
a BIG ASS army that he gonna use to put the

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.290
hurt on Paul.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:54.159
So Paul and the Fremen hop up on
they sandworms and wreck erry fool that step

00:02:54.159 --> 00:03:00.049
to. Then the emperor try to throw down but
Paul all like “AtreiDEEZ NUTS, son,” snatches

00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:05.540
the throne like a boss, and becomes the new
emperor. Thing is, since he can see the future,

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:10.420
he realize he ain’t gonna be able to stop
the bleak ass holy-war ahead of them.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:18.620
For some bruthas, Dune all bout the planet
Arrakis and ecology- how any

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:23.280
lil hood can transform a planet, and in turn,
be transformed by it. But fo’ this thug

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.900
right here, talkin bout my man Paul Atreides
is where it’s at.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:31.400
First off, the name Atriedes comes
from dat playa Agamemnon from Greek myth.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:36.500
Cuz like Agamemnon, even though Paul come
from a family that got solid street cred and

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.430
fat stacks, his future full o tragedy. Mmm!

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:43.859
See the thing I dig bout Paul is
dat even though he packin some sick powers,

00:03:43.859 --> 00:03:46.150
he know he ain’t all dat. Check it-

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:03.240
But that don’t stop people from
ridin his junk 24/7. Even though the Fremen

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:07.540
thinkin Paul tha playa of legend, they don’t
know the truth like he do.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.959
Eventually, Paul realize the
universe ain’t just the big unknown, it’s

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:16.859
da INFITINITE unknown. And Paul pity the fool
who think he, or anyone else, can control

00:04:16.859 --> 00:04:17.269
errything.

00:04:17.269 --> 00:04:21.859
So if like the Fremen, you bettin
all yo chips on a savior who can’t do no

00:04:21.859 --> 00:04:26.919
wrong, you straight trippin. Cuz they ain’t
nobody that can tame the infinite. Nuh-uh.

00:04:26.919 --> 00:04:31.020
Even Paul with his “I can see the past,
present, and future” bullsh** can’t do

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.980
nothin to stop the world from the mess that
lay ahead.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:54.090
But peeps gonna do what they do-
worship a savior who they thinkin gonna solve

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:59.060
all their problems. Even Paul’s realest
homies gonna JUMP at the chance to lay their

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.940
free will at dat playas feet.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.880
On the real, it ain’t a savior we
should be lookin for to fix our lives. We

00:05:19.919 --> 00:05:25.580
gotta use these righteous playas as an inspiration,
nut up, and make dat change ourselves.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:29.160
But ain’t nothin in yo life gonna
be fixed til you hit dat subscribe button.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.700
Catch you lata. Peace.

